<title>EGYPT: Kafr el-Zayat end-Q3 results.</title>
<headline>Kafr el-Zayat end-Q3 results.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the first nine months of financial year 1996/7, which started on July 1:</p>
<p>(All figures in Egyptian pounds, no comparative figures available):</p>
<p>Net sales			    60,756,980</p>
<p>Production costs		   42,707,658</p>
<p>Overheads			     4,372,527</p>
<p>Exceptional revenue		   500,630</p>
<p>Exceptional expenses		  726,610</p>
<p>Net profit before tax	    13,450,815</p>
<p>(Full company name is Kafr el-Zayat Pesticides and Chemicals)</p>
<p>$1 =3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
